# ResNet-50 pest classifier: raw image datasets, generated crops, and the
# trained model itself are all too large/numerous for git (the model alone
# exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file limit). Code, logs, and metrics JSON stay
# tracked so the exact model can be reproduced by rerunning the pipeline
# against a local copy of the dataset — see ml/resnet/README (if present) or
# ml/resnet/prepare_dataset.py + train.py docstrings for the run commands.
ml/resnet/bph/
ml/resnet/sb/
ml/resnet/negative/
ml/resnet/datasets/
ml/weights/*/resnet50_*.keras
